      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "ある国からの密書を回収してほしいのだ。\n密書を運んでいた使いが殺されてな。\n死ぬ前にある場所に隠したらしい。\nそいつを見つけてここへ持ってきてくれ。",
        "official_en": "There is a secret letter from a certain country, and\nits previous courier was killed, however, he was\nable to hide it before his death. I charge you with\nthis, traveler... Find it and bring it here to me.",
        "real_en": null
      },
